### Search patients (all filters optional, combine with page, size, sort)
# name / email: case-insensitive contains
# registeredFrom / registeredTo: yyyy-MM-dd, inclusive
GET http://localhost:4004/api/patients?name=john&registeredFrom=2024-01-01&registeredTo=2024-12-31&page=0&size=20&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
